{"type":"text","timestamp":1787443541697,"sessionID":"ses_fd41055b7ffePZG3ZUGYnYPSRR","part":{"id":"prt_02beff100001h5R1tnhJFTmA4S","messageID":"msg_02befed3f001oOZq5u1hlCWfMK","sessionID":"ses_fd41055b7ffePZG3ZUGYnYPSRR","type":"text","text":"All 9 tests pass (4 committed + 5 student).\n\n## Design\n\n**`summarizeAssistants(runs)`** (`summarize-assistants.mjs`): throws `TypeError` if `runs` isn't an array; filters to eligible runs (`status === \"complete\"`, `acceptance_status === \"pass\"`, `comparison_eligible !== false`); validates eligible runs' `run_id`/`assistant` (non-empty strings), `score` (0–100 finite), `elapsed_ms` (≥0 finite); groups by exact `assistant` via a `Map`; computes median from sorted times (averaging middle two for even counts); picks best by score desc, then elapsed asc, then `run_id` asc; sorts summaries by `assistant` string comparison without mutating input.\n\n**`renderComparisonTable(summaries)`** (`render-comparison-table.mjs`): throws `TypeError` for non-array/invalid summaries; preserves order; emits the exact header and separator; renders median as `(ms/1000).toFixed(3)` seconds; escapes `|` as `\\|`; renders the empty state with a blank line and `_No eligible runs._`.\n\n## Tests added (student-tests.mjs)\n\n1. Non-array `runs` throws `TypeError`.\n2. Ineligible runs with invalid fields are ignored; invalid eligible runs throw.\n3. Best-score tie broken by lower elapsed time, then smaller `run_id`.\n4. Even-count median averaging the two middle values (plus `run_count`).\n5. `renderComparisonTable` throws on invalid/empty-assistant summaries and on non-array input.\n\n## Verification\n\n`node --test ...` → 9/9 pass, 0 fail.","time":{"start":1787443540224,"end":1787443541695}}}
